    "01",
    "Academic success",
    "Reimagine advising, mentorship, and learning support so every Tar Heel has the guidance to thrive.",
    "Expand peer support and early feedback while advancing accessible, student-centered innovation in teaching and learning.",
    "priority-card--academic",
  ],
  [
    "02",
    "Basic needs and wellbeing",
    "Help every student reliably access food, housing, transportation, health, and safety resources.",
    "Centralize support, reduce practical barriers, and pursue partnerships that make essential resources easier to find and use.",
    "priority-card--needs",
  ],
  [
    "03",
    "Civic and community engagement",
    "Strengthen Carolina's culture of service and the connection between students, campus, and the wider community.",
    "Create more routes into public service, civic participation, respectful dialogue, and town-university collaboration.",
    "priority-card--civic",
  ],
  [
    "04",
    "Diversity, equity, and inclusion",
    "Build a Carolina where every student feels seen, supported, respected, and able to participate fully.",
    "Invest in belonging, cultural programming, shared understanding, and equitable access across campus life.",
    "priority-card--belonging",
  ],
  [
    "05",
    "Communication and transparency",
    "Tell Carolina's story authentically and ensure student voices help shape university decisions.",
    "Publish clear benchmarks, timelines, and progress updates so students can see what the administration is doing and hold it accountable.",
